	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Also when you choose this archetype at 3rd level, you harness the power of creativity to channel it through your very form. You gain the following two Channel Divinity options:</p><h2>Divine Inspiration</h2><p>Failure is an important part of the creative process, but sometimes all someone needs is a little extra encouragement to avoid it. When a creature you can see within 30 feet of you fails a Performance check or an ability check made with a tool kit, you may immediately use your reaction to add your Charisma modifier (minimum 1) to the roll.</p><h2>Divine Muse</h2><p>Inspiring creativity in others also helps inspire it in you as either collaborator or muse. As a bonus action, you may become temporarily proficient in one artisan’s toolkit or musical instrument of your choosing for the next 24 hours.</p>",
